,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Logan County runs from 1951 to 2025 over 8 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years, the most of any pair, and June to July in 29. In 2025 on the middle, February to March came in at 47% of normal, then November to December at 168%. So far in 2026 on the middle, every published pair came in under 90%, with May to June at 67%.</p>"}
